  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Survivors of SEAH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to build on pockets of promising learning and practice that have emerged in the past years to support survivors of GBV and VAWG in Malawi, pivot these to include survivors of SEAH, and pilot these to learn how effective they are in enabling survivors of SEAH to access the support they need.</narrative>
  </description>
